    kind: work_item  # a27c
    title: "Exit status minted as untrusted_input at os.wait*/Child.wait but not at call/check_call/system/Run/Command::status: one value, two verdicts (INV-lozat's acknowledged disagreement) -- reconcile under the WI-dozul rule after T2's delta"  # a27c
    status: todo_hard  # a27c
    priority: 3  # a27c
    parent:  # a27c
    tags:  # a27c
    - taint  # a27c
